WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:02:21.388 --> 00:02:23.856
What happened to you, Ryoko?!

00:02:25.091 --> 00:02:27.321
What's going on?

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:39.768
What's all the ruckus?

00:02:42.576 --> 00:02:46.279
R-Ryoko's wearing... makeup!

00:02:46.279 --> 00:02:50.045
M-M-M-Makeup!

00:02:57.524 --> 00:03:00.687
You bastards, what's so funny?!

00:03:11.071 --> 00:03:14.268
Damn it! That does it, I give up.

00:03:15.775 --> 00:03:18.539
- She's giving up?
- I doubt that.

00:03:28.555 --> 00:03:29.715
"Pro Wrestling Monthly"

00:03:30.023 --> 00:03:31.725
This move is awesome!

00:03:31.725 --> 00:03:34.294
Yeah, it sure is!

00:03:34.294 --> 00:03:36.057
You give up?

00:03:38.198 --> 00:03:41.067
What weirdos...

00:03:41.067 --> 00:03:43.603
- The weather sure is great.
Wanna go up to the roof?
- Sure!

00:03:43.603 --> 00:03:46.071
Let's look at my style magazine!

00:03:52.579 --> 00:03:54.381
Pining away again, Masaki?

00:03:54.381 --> 00:03:55.982
I'm gonna take you down!

00:03:55.982 --> 00:03:57.417
Cut it out!

00:03:57.417 --> 00:04:00.253
I guess even a loverboy
hits some rough patches, huh?

00:04:00.253 --> 00:04:03.390
Check out this guy! Isn't he cute?

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:06.226
Pass. Younger guys make me feel old.

00:04:06.226 --> 00:04:08.361
I like guys who are wilder.

00:04:08.361 --> 00:04:09.963
How about this guy?

00:04:09.963 --> 00:04:12.799
What, this monkey-looking guy?

00:04:12.799 --> 00:04:16.002
Are you dumb? The monkey look is in now!

00:04:16.002 --> 00:04:17.237
No way!

00:04:17.237 --> 00:04:19.673
Let's check out the next one!

00:04:19.673 --> 00:04:22.776
There sure aren't many of my type in here.

00:04:22.776 --> 00:04:25.278
This guy is so my type!

00:04:25.278 --> 00:04:26.446
Huh? Which?

00:04:26.446 --> 00:04:28.381
Hey, how about you, Sakuya?

00:04:28.381 --> 00:04:29.015
Huh?

00:04:29.015 --> 00:04:31.347
What kind of guy do you like?

00:04:33.153 --> 00:04:35.121
Uh... Let me think...

00:04:35.121 --> 00:04:36.713
Who?

00:04:37.624 --> 00:04:40.493
Somebody who would wait for me, I guess.

00:04:40.493 --> 00:04:42.362
Somebody who would wait for you?

00:04:42.362 --> 00:04:46.266
What's that supposed to mean? I don't get it.

00:04:46.266 --> 00:04:49.035
Me, neither.

00:04:49.035 --> 00:04:50.170
Sorry!

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:53.740
Geez... You're such a baby.
That's the problem with you.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:57.677
We're not getting any younger.

00:04:57.677 --> 00:04:59.846
Yep. Better find one while we're young.

00:04:59.846 --> 00:05:01.781
I guess you're right.

00:05:01.781 --> 00:05:04.451
Look at this guy! I want him!

00:05:04.451 --> 00:05:05.285
Are you serious?

00:05:05.285 --> 00:05:06.946
Hey, he's not too bad!

00:05:12.058 --> 00:05:14.117
And then I asked for her phone number.

00:05:14.995 --> 00:05:17.225
You never learn, do you?

00:05:38.485 --> 00:05:40.476
I wonder who called?

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:45.683
You have two messages.

00:05:47.927 --> 00:05:50.630
Tenchi, I'm coming over this Sunday.

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:53.266
Let's go out on a date
behind that idiot Ayeka's back.

00:05:53.266 --> 00:05:55.468
I'll meet you at the
park by the train station.

00:05:55.468 --> 00:05:57.637
Don't stand me up! Be there!

00:05:57.637 --> 00:06:00.340
If you don't show up, there's
no telling what might happen.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:01.141
See ya!

00:06:01.141 --> 00:06:02.142
Yes, Ma'am...

00:06:02.142 --> 00:06:04.678
Masaki? This is Sakuya.

00:06:04.678 --> 00:06:07.580
I was thinking that if the weather's
nice, maybe we could go for a walk

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:10.717
in the park by the
train station this Sunday.

00:06:10.717 --> 00:06:15.518
If you aren't doing
anything, give me a call. 'Bye.

00:06:46.319 --> 00:06:47.954
Tenchi!

00:06:47.954 --> 00:06:52.482
You'd better be there, Tenchi!

00:07:03.903 --> 00:07:07.304
I guess she'd never
be on time for anything...

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:17.917
Come to think of it, have I ever
been out alone with Ryoko before?

00:07:17.917 --> 00:07:19.719
Tenchi.

00:07:19.719 --> 00:07:21.346
You're late!

00:07:28.094 --> 00:07:31.131
Sorry, Tenchi!

00:07:31.131 --> 00:07:33.600
I bet you were lonely!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.269
You can flirt with me as
much as you want today!

00:07:36.269 --> 00:07:37.504
You must be happy, huh?

00:07:37.504 --> 00:07:39.472
Come off it, Ryoko!

00:07:42.108 --> 00:07:46.446
What do you think?
Don't I look pretty today?

00:07:46.446 --> 00:07:48.915
Ryoko... Did something happen to you?

00:07:48.915 --> 00:07:50.984
Hey!

00:07:50.984 --> 00:07:55.318
"Something" is about to happen...

00:07:58.191 --> 00:08:03.730
Hey, this ain't no peepshow!
Beat it, you bums! Scram!

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:05.899
Let's go, Tenchi.

00:08:05.899 --> 00:08:08.368
Let's go someplace fancy.

00:08:08.368 --> 00:08:11.471
All right, all right, just leggo!

00:08:11.471 --> 00:08:14.099
That settles it, then! Let's go, Tenchi!

00:08:31.291 --> 00:08:33.493
Gimme another! And make it a jumbo!

00:08:33.493 --> 00:08:35.795
This is your idea of someplace fancy?

00:08:35.795 --> 00:08:40.562
Don't be an idiot! Beef bowl
joints are trendy now! Look around!

00:08:45.338 --> 00:08:47.829
I was so mad!

00:08:50.343 --> 00:08:52.946
I don't get it...

00:08:52.946 --> 00:08:56.211
Here, Tenchi... Open wide!

00:09:01.187 --> 00:09:02.555
Go for it, Hiroshi!

00:09:02.555 --> 00:09:04.785
You got it! Watch this!

00:09:08.728 --> 00:09:10.525
That was great!

00:09:19.873 --> 00:09:22.000
That felt great!

00:09:22.976 --> 00:09:24.477
Damn it...

00:09:24.477 --> 00:09:27.213
What's the big idea, Tenchi?

00:09:27.213 --> 00:09:29.374
That hurts!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:34.243
"Photo Sticker World"

00:09:35.822 --> 00:09:39.019
Ryoko, this is hopeless...

00:09:42.528 --> 00:09:46.366
Tenchi! Tenchi! Over here!

00:09:46.366 --> 00:09:48.501
Over here! Over here! This one's open!

00:09:48.501 --> 00:09:49.035
"ID Photos"
Over here! Over here! This one's open!

00:09:49.035 --> 00:09:49.763
"ID Photos"

00:09:50.236 --> 00:09:52.227
ID photos?

00:09:56.209 --> 00:10:02.273
? ...that's a woman's sentiment!?

00:10:10.189 --> 00:10:12.180
What the hell?!

00:10:15.028 --> 00:10:18.531
You gotta be kiddin' me!

00:10:18.531 --> 00:10:19.565
Ryoko!

00:10:19.565 --> 00:10:20.934
Leggo!

00:10:20.934 --> 00:10:22.568
I'm never coming back to this dump!

00:10:22.568 --> 00:10:24.798
Cut it out!

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.305
Let's go to the next place!

00:10:59.305 --> 00:11:00.273
There's no "next."

00:11:00.273 --> 00:11:02.675
Why not? We're having
a good time, aren't we?

00:11:02.675 --> 00:11:04.644
You are, anyway...

00:11:04.644 --> 00:11:07.280
Then let's have some more fun!

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:08.848
Listen, I...

00:11:08.848 --> 00:11:11.818
What's the problem?
If it's fun, it can't be bad, right?

00:11:11.818 --> 00:11:12.952
Yes, it can!

00:11:12.952 --> 00:11:15.250
You've gotta do something about that.

00:11:16.422 --> 00:11:19.118
Damn it, give it a rest!

00:11:32.572 --> 00:11:36.642
Ryoko? Are you in there?

00:11:36.642 --> 00:11:39.879
Ryoko?

00:11:39.879 --> 00:11:41.676
I'm coming in.

00:11:42.181 --> 00:11:44.172
Ryoko?

00:11:47.387 --> 00:11:49.188
Huh?

00:11:49.188 --> 00:11:54.148
"Color your night wonderful...
Night Pearl Rouge"?

00:12:02.635 --> 00:12:04.125
Pretty!

00:12:09.008 --> 00:12:12.478
What? What's with that
weird look on your face?

00:12:12.478 --> 00:12:15.140
Ryoko's wearing makeup?

00:12:17.116 --> 00:12:20.453
Wh-What? What're you laughing at?!

00:12:20.453 --> 00:12:21.821
Nothing.

00:12:21.821 --> 00:12:23.982
"Nothing," huh?

00:12:26.659 --> 00:12:29.529
We're going someplace else, right?

00:12:29.529 --> 00:12:31.087
Here.

00:12:40.807 --> 00:12:42.502
Tenchi...

00:14:21.841 --> 00:14:24.777
That's all it was...

00:14:24.777 --> 00:14:26.574
That's all.

00:14:41.494 --> 00:14:45.328
Geez, look at what the
<i>#1 space pirate has turned into...</i>

00:14:47.767 --> 00:14:49.701
Tenchi!

00:14:52.338 --> 00:14:54.040
Here.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:58.010
Damn it, what's the big idea?

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.308
Wanna go anyplace else?

00:15:03.482 --> 00:15:06.986
- You better believe it!
- Okay, okay...

00:15:06.986 --> 00:15:09.978
Or so I'd like to say...
I think I'll call it a day.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.633
It's almost like I had too much fun.

00:15:20.633 --> 00:15:22.123
Ryoko...

00:15:25.204 --> 00:15:31.244
See ya! Let's go out again sometime, Tenchi!

00:15:31.244 --> 00:15:34.771
See you around, Tenchi!

00:15:44.257 --> 00:15:46.987
Man, what a flake...

00:15:53.032 --> 00:15:58.561
Still... She was kinda cute.

00:16:00.573 --> 00:16:02.473
Masaki...

00:16:23.362 --> 00:16:25.830
Kumashiro...

00:16:32.805 --> 00:16:34.295
Here.

00:16:46.085 --> 00:16:50.351
You... You waited for me all this time.

00:16:52.558 --> 00:16:55.695
I was thinking that if the weather's
nice, maybe we could go for a walk

00:16:55.695 --> 00:16:58.831
in the park by the
train station this Sunday.

00:16:58.831 --> 00:17:02.767
If you're not doing anything,
give me a call. 'Bye.

00:17:06.272 --> 00:17:07.762
I'm sorry.

00:17:13.112 --> 00:17:19.151
I... I was thinking while
I was sitting there alone.

00:17:19.151 --> 00:17:22.455
I was wondering if
I had done something wrong.

00:17:22.455 --> 00:17:25.057
Something wrong? Of course not.

00:17:25.057 --> 00:17:28.594
Well, I'm the type that
gets worked up really easily.

00:17:28.594 --> 00:17:29.995
That's not it at all...

00:17:29.995 --> 00:17:32.698
And I don't have that great a figure.

00:17:32.698 --> 00:17:34.700
That's not it at all!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.602
And I'm a bad cook, too.

00:17:36.602 --> 00:17:38.729
That's not it at all!

00:17:43.609 --> 00:17:48.171
There's something
strange about all this, huh?

00:17:50.249 --> 00:17:54.553
There's this image
I've always had in my head.

00:17:54.553 --> 00:17:57.156
On the way home from school,

00:17:57.156 --> 00:18:00.426
I'd be alone, walking from the
school building in the evening.

00:18:00.426 --> 00:18:05.398
The shadows would be really long,
and someone would be waiting for me.

00:18:05.398 --> 00:18:08.934
Of course, it'd be okay
if I had to wait for him, too.

00:18:08.934 --> 00:18:12.529
In that time, I'd be alone,
but I really wouldn't be.

00:18:15.841 --> 00:18:22.615
And I'd hold that person
who was waiting for me.

00:18:22.615 --> 00:18:25.418
That's what I want to do for the one I love.

00:18:25.418 --> 00:18:29.822
That's what I'd want him to do for me.
That's what I've always wanted!

00:18:29.822 --> 00:18:39.131
But... But then I found out.
You already have someone waiting for you.

00:18:39.131 --> 00:18:41.895
No! That's...

00:18:43.068 --> 00:18:45.438
That's a lie!

00:18:45.438 --> 00:18:49.375
Whenever you lie, your nostrils flare.

00:18:49.375 --> 00:18:50.899
Did you know that?

00:18:57.082 --> 00:19:00.586
I knew you'd be a terrible liar, Masaki.

00:19:00.586 --> 00:19:02.383
No! You've got it all wrong!

00:19:13.332 --> 00:19:15.095
Up until now...

00:19:20.105 --> 00:19:21.595
I'm sorry.

00:19:23.342 --> 00:19:25.333
Goodbye.

00:20:11.423 --> 00:20:14.793
Wh-What do you
think's wrong with Ryoko?

00:20:14.793 --> 00:20:16.061
Something fishy is going on!

00:20:16.061 --> 00:20:17.396
I guess the millenium
may come a little early...

00:20:17.396 --> 00:20:20.499
Maybe something
really good happened to her.

00:20:20.499 --> 00:20:23.469
I don't like this! Not one bit!

00:20:23.469 --> 00:20:26.996
What's wrong, Ayeka? You look so scary!

00:20:28.274 --> 00:20:29.575
It's nothing!

00:20:29.575 --> 00:20:32.077
Oh. Okay.

00:20:32.077 --> 00:20:36.241
Hey, I'll give you one of these fried eggs!

00:20:40.152 --> 00:20:41.744
Ryoko...

00:20:50.596 --> 00:20:53.190
That was a freebie.

00:21:36.075 --> 00:21:39.678
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.678 --> 00:21:43.582
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.582 --> 00:21:47.186
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.186 --> 00:21:51.123
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.123 --> 00:21:54.627
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.627 --> 00:21:58.597
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.597 --> 00:22:01.934
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:01.934 --> 00:22:05.938
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:05.938 --> 00:22:08.073
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.073 --> 00:22:10.009
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.009 --> 00:22:11.510
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:17.349
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.349 --> 00:22:21.453
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.453 --> 00:22:24.723
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.723 --> 00:22:28.260
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:32.959
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:43.242 --> 00:22:45.744
Hi! Sasami here!

00:22:45.744 --> 00:22:50.482
Ryo-Ohki's been doing
nothing but playing tricks lately!

00:22:50.482 --> 00:22:53.652
Ryo-Ohki! What did you do that for?!

00:22:53.652 --> 00:22:57.556
How could you break Grandpa
Masaki's precious Buddha statue!

00:22:57.556 --> 00:23:03.962
And now you're lying and trying
to cover it up! I've had enough!

00:23:03.962 --> 00:23:10.231
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"Moon Mission."
